ng and calendar views</li><li>Subscription charts</li><li>Calculation interface</li><li>Cached data-fetching backend</li></ul><h4>Architecture</h4><p>React frontend → Express routes → in-memory cache and scheduled Puppeteer data collection.</p><p class="flag" data-review-mode>Needs owner review · media not yet cleared for release.</p></article><article class="record" id="record-nyay-ai" data-record-view="nyay-ai" hidden aria-labelledby="record-nyay-ai-title"><a class="back" href="/projects/" data-nav="projects"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.5 12h-16M10 6.5 4.5 12l5.5 5.5"/></svg> Projects</a><h3 class="record__title" id="record-nyay-ai-title" tabindex="-1">NyayAI</h3><p class="record__kicker">AI &amp; Data · Experiment · Prototype</p><p class="lead">An AI-assisted legal-document prototype with OCR, plain-language explanations, and speech interfaces.</p><ul class="tags" role="list" aria-label="Technologies"><li>React</li><li>TypeScript</li><li>AWS Lambda</li><li>Amazon Textract</li><li>Amazon Bedrock</li><li>Amazon Polly</li><li>Tailwind CSS</li></ul><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/URAYUSHJAIN/NyayAI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 19.6c-4 1.2-4-2-5.6-2.4M14.6 21.6v-3.4c0-1 .1-1.4-.5-2 2.8-.3 5.6-1.4 5.6-6.2a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1.3-3.3 4.5 4.5 0 0 0-.1-3.3s-1-.3-3.4 1.3a11.6 11.6 0 0 0-6 0C6.5 3.1 5.4 3.4 5.4 3.4a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-.1 3.3A4.8 4.8 0 0 0 4 10c0 4.8 2.8 5.9 5.6 6.2-.6.6-.6 1.2-.5 2v3.4"/></svg> View source on GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div><figure class="media"><video controls preload="none" playsinline src="/review-media/review/projects/plant-disease-detector/client-side-ai-apps.mp4" aria-label="NyayAI walkthrough video"></video><figcaption>Project walkthrough — part of a combined BuildLog episode; it starts at this project’s segment. No captions are available; the description below covers the same work.</figcaption></figure><h4>Problem</h4><p>Legal documents can be difficult to read, especially when technical language and accessibility barriers overlap.</p><h4>What it does</h4><p>The repository defines a React frontend and AWS services for text extraction, language-model explanations, and text-to-speech. Its README explicitly identifies Kiro-assisted creation. This is a software experiment; legal correctness, accessibility conformance, and production readiness have not been independently verified.</p><h4>Verified features</h4><ul class="bullets"><li>Document-upload flow</li><li>Textract integration</li><li>Bedrock simplification integration</li><li>Polly speech integration</li></ul><h4>Architecture</h4><p>React frontend with AWS Lambda/API Gateway services for Textract, Bedrock and Polly integrations.</p><p class="flag" data-review-mode>Needs owner review · media not yet cleared for release.</p></article><article class="record" id="record-placement-tracker" data-record-view="placement-tracker" hidden aria-labelledby="record-placement-tracker-title"><a class="back" href="/projects/" data-nav="projects"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.5 12h-16M10 6.5 4.5 12l5.5 5.5"/></svg> Projects</a><h3 class="record__title" id="record-placement-tracker-title" tabindex="-1">Placement Tracker</h3><p class="record__kicker">Tools · Experiment · Prototype</p><p class="lead">A local-first PWA for tracking placement applications and backing them up as JSON.</p><ul class="tags" role="list" aria-label="Technologie