a/review/derived/placement-tracker/tr-three.480.webp" width="480" height="480" alt="Placement Tracker — interface capture" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></li></ul><h4>Problem</h4><p>Application deadlines, statuses, and notes can become hard to manage across separate documents.</p><h4>What it does</h4><p>The application stores entries in browser storage and includes import/export, deadline reminders, and an installable PWA shell. Local persistence is device-specific; it is not evidence of automatic synchronization between devices.</p><h4>Verified features</h4><ul class="bullets"><li>Application entries and status tracking</li><li>JSON import and export</li><li>PWA installation</li><li>Reminder interfaces</li></ul><h4>Architecture</h4><p>Browser interface and service worker with localStorage persistence and JSON import/export.</p><p class="flag" data-review-mode>Needs owner review · media not yet cleared for release.</p></article><article class="record" id="record-plant-disease-detector" data-record-view="plant-disease-detector" hidden aria-labelledby="record-plant-disease-detector-title"><a class="back" href="/projects/" data-nav="projects"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.5 12h-16M10 6.5 4.5 12l5.5 5.5"/></svg> Projects</a><h3 class="record__title" id="record-plant-disease-detector-title" tabindex="-1">Plant Disease Detector</h3><p class="record__kicker">AI &amp; Data · Experiment · Prototype</p><p class="lead">A browser interface that sends plant photographs to Gemini for suggested disease explanations.</p><ul class="tags" role="list" aria-label="Technologies"><li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>Gemini</li></ul><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/URAYUSHJAIN/Agri-ai-assistant" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon" width="18" h