aign browsing</li><li>Campaign creation interface</li><li>Wallet connection</li><li>Donation-contract integration</li></ul><h4>Architecture</h4><p>React/Vite campaign interface → Ethers.js wallet integration → Solidity contract functions.</p><p class="flag" data-review-mode>Needs owner review · media not yet cleared for release.</p></article><article class="record" id="record-skillforge" data-record-view="skillforge" hidden aria-labelledby="record-skillforge-title"><a class="back" href="/projects/" data-nav="projects"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.5 12h-16M10 6.5 4.5 12l5.5 5.5"/></svg> Projects</a><h3 class="record__title" id="record-skillforge-title" tabindex="-1">SkillForge LMS</h3><p class="record__kicker">Full-stack · Experiment · Prototype</p><p class="lead">A learning-management prototype with course content, enrollment, and separate learner and administrator interfaces.</p><ul class="tags" role="list" aria-label="Technologies"><li>React</li><li>Vite</li><li>Node.js</li><li>Express</li><li>PostgreSQL</li><li>Tailwind CSS</li></ul><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/URAYUSHJAIN/skillforge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg class="icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 19.6c-4 1.2-4-2-5.6-2.4M14.6 21.6v-3.4c0-1 .1-1.4-.5-2 2.8-.3 5.6-1.4 5.6-6.2a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1.3-3.3 4.5 4.5 0 0 0-.1-3.3s-1-.3-3.4 1.3a11.6 11.6 0 0 0-6 0C6.5 3.1 5.4 3.4 5.4 3.4a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-.1 3.3A4.8 4.8 0 0 0 4 10c0 4.8 2.8 5.9 5.6 6.2-.6.6-.6 1.2-.5 2v3.4"/></svg> View source on GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div><figure class="media"><video controls preload="none" playsinline src="/review