-hidden="true"></div><div class="drawer-wall drawer-wall--left" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="drawer-wall drawer-wall--right" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="panel__sheet"><header class="panel__head"><span class="panel__tab" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon" width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg></span><div class="panel__titles"><h2 class="panel__title" id="panel-patents-title" tabindex="-1">Patents</h2><p class="panel__meta">8 application records</p></div><a class="panel__close" href="/" data-nav="home" aria-label="Close Patents"><svg class="icon" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.5 12h-16M10 6.5 4.5 12l5.5 5.5"/></svg></a></header><p class="panel__review" data-review-mode>Local review preview · entries await owner approval and are excluded from release builds.</p><div class="panel__body"><p class="muted">Invention applications on which Ayush Jain is a named inventor. Statuses come from dated official snapshots; current legal status has not been verified, and no application is presented as a grant.</p><ul class="files" role="list"><li><details class="file" id="patent-genshakti-energy-saver"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">GenShakti: AI-Driven Smart Energy Saver</span><span class="file__sub">Application No. 202511025277</span></span><span class="pill pill--ok">Application published</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>An application describing AI-assisted monitoring and optimization of electricity consumption.</p><p class="muted">The published abstract proposes collecting electricity-usage data, analyzing consumption patterns, and presenting optimization guidance. The record describes the proposed system; it does not establish measured energy savings or an issued patent right.</p><dl class="facts"><dt>Official title</dt><dd>GENSHAKTI: AI-DRIVEN SMART ENERGY SAVER</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Named inventor</dd><dt>Applicant</dt><dd>ABES Engineering College</dd><dt>Office</dt><dd>Indian Patent Office</dd><dt>Filed</dt><dd>20 Mar 2025</dd><dt>Published</dt><dd>4 Apr 2025 · Journal issue 14/2025</dd><dt>Status note</dt><dd>Application publication recorded on 2025-04-04; official snapshot captured 2025-04-10. Current legal status has not been verified.</dd></dl><a class="btn" href="https://iprsearch.ipindia.gov.in/PublicSearch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search Indian Patent Office <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.5 4h6.5v6.5M20 4l-9 9M17.5 14v5.5h-13v-13H10"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></details></li><li><details class="file" id="patent-genshakti-zone-selection"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">GenShakti: AI-Driven Smart Zone Selection for Renewable Energy</span><span class="file__sub">Application No. 202511025280</span></span><span class="pill pill--ok">Application published</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>An application describing geospatial analysis for identifying renewable-energy installation zones.</p><p class="muted">The proposed system combines geographic data collection, machine-learning processing, and a mapping interface to compare potential renewable-energy sites. These are application claims, without independently validated site-selection performance.</p><dl class="facts"><dt>Official title</dt><dd>GENSHAKTI: AI-DRIVEN SMART ZONE SELECTION FOR RENEWABLE ENERGY</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Named inventor</dd><dt>Applicant</dt><dd>ABES Engineering College</dd><dt>Office</dt><dd>Indian Patent Office</dd><dt>Filed</dt><dd>20 Mar 2025</dd><dt>Published</dt><dd>4 Apr 2025 · Journal issue 14/2025</dd><dt>Status note</dt><dd>Application publication recorded on 2025-04-04; official snapshot captured 2025-04-10. Current legal status has not been verified.</dd></dl><a class="btn" href="https://iprsearch.ipindia.gov.in/PublicSearch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search Indian Patent Office <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.5 4h6.5v6.5M20 4l-9 9M17.5 14v5.5h-13v-13H10"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></details></li><li><details class="file" id="patent-decentralized-document-control"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">Decentralized Document Control System</span><span class="file__sub">Application No. 202511052005</span></span><span class="pill pill--ok">Application published</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>An application describing document storage and controlled sharing using blockchain and IPFS.</p><p class="muted">The abstract names the proposed platform DocMitra and describes smart-contract access rules, selective disclosure, and key recovery. The portfolio presents the research proposal, without claiming a deployed document-management product.</p><dl class="facts"><dt>Official title</dt><dd>DECENTRALIZED DOCUMENT CONTROL SYSTEM</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Named inventor</dd><dt>Applicant</dt><dd>ABES Engineering College</dd><dt>Office</dt><dd>Indian Patent Office</dd><dt>Filed</dt><dd>29 May 2025</dd><dt>Published</dt><dd>13 Jun 2025 · Journal issue 24/2025</dd><dt>Status note</dt><dd>Application publication recorded on 2025-06-13; official snapshot captured 2025-07-15. Current legal status has not been verified.</dd></dl><a class="btn" href="https://iprsearch.ipindia.gov.in/PublicSearch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search Indian Patent Office <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.5 4h6.5v6.5M20 4l-9 9M17.5 14v5.5h-13v-13H10"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></details></li><li><details class="file" id="patent-pharmaceutical-supply-chain"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">Blockchain-Driven Pharmaceutical Supply Chain Optimizer</span><span class="file__sub">Application No. 202511052013</span></span><span class="pill pill--ok">Application published</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>An application proposing blockchain-based drug-inventory tracking and expiry-management workflows.</p><p class="muted">The abstract describes tracking inventory, managing expiry through smart contracts, and supporting redistribution of near-expiry medicines. It also uses the name ArogyaPlus; this does not establish a relationship to the separate medical-report application or repository.</p><dl class="facts"><dt>Official title</dt><dd>BLOCKCHAIN-DRIVEN PHARMACEUTICAL SUPPLY CHAIN OPTIMIZER</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Named inventor</dd><dt>Applicant</dt><dd>ABES Engineering College</dd><dt>Office</dt><dd>Indian Patent Office</dd><dt>Filed</dt><dd>29 May 2025</dd><dt>Published</dt><dd>13 Jun 2025 · Journal issue 24/2025</dd><dt>Status note</dt><dd>Application publication recorded on 2025-06-13; official snapshot captured 2025-07-15. Current legal status has not been verified.</dd></dl><a class="btn" href="https://iprsearch.ipindia.gov.in/PublicSearch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search Indian Patent Office <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.5 4h6.5v6.5M20 4l-9 9M17.5 14v5.5h-13v-13H10"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></details></li><li><details class="file" id="patent-arogyaplus-medical-insights"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">ArogyaPlus: Smart Medical Insights Navigator</span><span class="file__sub">Application No. 202511053923</span></span><span class="pill pill--ok">Application published</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>An application proposing AI-assisted interpretation and explanation of medical reports.</p><p class="muted">The abstract describes extracting report information with OCR, computer vision, and language processing, then presenting health-information explanations. This is an application-level proposal, without clinical validation or a claim of regulatory approval.</p><dl class="facts"><dt>Official title</dt><dd>AROGYAPLUS: SMART MEDICAL INSIGHTS NAVIGATOR</dd><dt>Role</dt><dd>Named inventor</dd><dt>Applicant</dt><dd>ABES Engineering College</dd><dt>Office</dt><dd>Indian Patent Office</dd><dt>Filed</dt><dd>4 Jun 2025</dd><dt>Published</dt><dd>20 Jun 2025 · Journal issue 25/2025</dd><dt>Status note</dt><dd>Application publication recorded on 2025-06-20; official snapshot captured 2025-07-15. Current legal status has not been verified.</dd></dl><a class="btn" href="https://iprsearch.ipindia.gov.in/PublicSearch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Search Indian Patent Office <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.5 4h6.5v6.5M20 4l-9 9M17.5 14v5.5h-13v-13H10"/></svg><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></details></li><li><details class="file" id="patent-promptly"><summary><svg class="icon file__icon" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 2.8h8.2L19 7.6V21.2H6z"/><path d="M14 2.8v5h5M9 11.2h7M9 14.4h7M9 17.6h5"/></svg><span class="file__main"><span class="file__title">Promptly: Prompt Versioning SaaS</span><span class="file__sub">Official record pending</span></span><span class="pill pill--muted">Status not verified</span></summary><div class="file__body"><p>A source-documented application concerning version management